library "Both Representation".

concept "Implanted Estrogen Pellets":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `a`.
concept "Implanted Estradiol Pellets":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `b`.
concept "Implanted Estrogen Or Estradiol Pellets":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `c`.
- defined as ( "Implanted Estrogen Pellets" sem-or "Implanted Estradiol Pellets" ).


decision "Implanted Pellet HRT Coverage Determination":
first:
- when "Implanted Estrogen Or Estradiol Pellets" then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".
- otherwise then recommend activity "certify.Approve".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: APPROVE / Certified.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: DENY / Not Certified.`.
